l comparisons were not performed and references to differences among groups are based on observation only.\"},\n   {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analyses were performed using SAS software (version 9.4; SAS Institute).\"}\n ],\n \"confidence\": \"medium\",\n \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}\n```", "type": "text"}]}